<title>USA: Solon Community School Dist., Iowa postpones sale.</title>
<headline>Solon Community School Dist., Iowa postpones sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solon Community School District, Iowa, said Thursday it has postponed a $2.2 million school refunding bond sale that had been slated for today.</p>
<p>A new sales date has not been selected yet.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
